Hi Benson,
A release candidate for 4.1.2 has been recently published [1]. We are
currently in the process of verifying and validating it. Expect it to be
released soon.

[1] https://lists.apache.org/thread/ff002gcyvhslhz7rwnvz07fmpd34p6t3

Best,

On Wed, Mar 4, 2026 at 10:02=E2=80=AFAM Xiong, Benson via users <
users@kafka.apache.org> wrote:

> Hi Everyone,
>
>
> According to https://kafka.apache.org/blog/releases/, 4.2.0 was released
> on Feb 17,  I=E2=80=99m wondering will kafka 4.1.2(
> https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/display/KAFKA/Release+Plan+4.1.2)
> still be released and when?
>
> The page
> https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/display/KAFKA/Future+release+plan
> does not mention 4.1.2. Can anyone help to clarify?
>
>
> Thanks
> Benson
>
