Hi Kafka experts,

I have a large-scale distributed system that takes around 200K connections =
to single broker on various topic partitions. I sometimes see my SSL port b=
ecomes unresponsive to client with high metadata latency when I sudden spik=
e of around 30K connections (when a broker restarts or it become leader whe=
n any other high traffic broker goes for a repair). Is there a reliable way=
 to tune the config to suit the load?

Regards,
Nanda


