Hi Apoorva,
I made a typo in my email, I was referring to CVE-2025-5115. The short =
answer is upgrade to Kafka >=3D 4.1.0 to get a version of Jetty that =
addresses this issue.

Kind regards,
Jim

> On 12 Mar 2026, at 07:17, Apoorva Maheshwari =
<apoorva.maheshwari@ericsson.com> wrote:
>=20
> Hello Jim,
> =20
> Thanks for the quick response.
> =20
