Just wondering how to interpret KIP-1101 release notes please.

The summary says it=92s part of 4.1.0: https://kafka.apache.org/blog/2025/0=
9/04/apache-kafka-4.1.0-release-announcement/
But the release notes don=92t mention it: https://archive.apache.org/dist/k=
afka/4.1.0/RELEASE_NOTES.html

Ah, searching for the title I find this: [KAFKA-17747<https://issues.apache=
.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-17747>] - Trigger rebalance on rack topology changes
So it=92s changed number maybe?

Also wonder if any performance benchmarking results are available please? T=
hanks, Paul
